    "Depth of feeling reinforces itself here, so close relationships, the arts, hospitality and caring work often bring great satisfaction. The pull involves trust. The Pig tends to believe the best of people; Scorpio expects to uncover hidden agendas. A Scorpio Pig may oscillate between generous openness and sudden withdrawal when let down. Seen as complexity, it gives balanced judgement once both instincts are consulted. It can help to give trust in stages rather than all at once, letting people earn deeper access over time. Consider moderation, too, with indulgences such as food, spending or late nights, since double Water's appetite for pleasure can run deep. Small limits protect the enjoyment rather than diminishing it, and keep the generous spirit well.",
